index ea1a1a0..f4d2d13 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,22 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- **`v1` `Files.Add` takes a file name and reader.** The signature changed
+  from `Add(ctx, body, contentType)` to `Add(ctx, fileName, content)`, matching
+  `v1` `CallLogs.AddRecording`: pass the file name and raw content and the SDK
+  builds the multipart/form-data body. Callers that previously encoded the
+  multipart body themselves should drop that encoding.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- **`v1` `Files.Add` uploads now retry.** The multipart body is built in
+  memory, so the HTTP transport can replay it and uploads are retried on 429
+  and, with `RetryPolicy.RetryAllMethods`, on 502/503/504 like every other
+  call. Previously a body read from `os.Open` had no replay function, so the
+  first 429 failed the upload immediately.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
